{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"X\",\n  \"x_off\": [\n    \"S01、S07、S10 等段有时把冲突具体化为离开后的孤单、是否回去以及能否安稳生活，略微偏向去留焦虑，但仍保留了尊严与归属之间的拉扯。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"S09 将“舍不得被当作自己人的日子，还是害怕孤单到愿意重新忍受委屈”的冲突，改成“怀念以前的生活，还是只想有人陪伴”，弱化了维护尊严这一核心力量，也把归属感缩窄成陪伴需求。\",\n    \"S13 将“为了留住亲近，会不会重新咽下委屈”的反复拉扯，改成对未来孤单和何时有人亲近的担忧，使尊严与归属之间的相互牵制变得不够突出。\",\n    \"S08 对怀念对象的描述也从被当作自己人的归属感，泛化成过去亲近的时光，减少了 Center 中归属这一层的明确性。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"X 更完整地呈现了怀念归属与拒绝再次委屈自己如何反复相互牵制，尤其在 S09 和 S13，两股力量都在场并直接发生冲突。Y 则多次把这场冲突转向孤单和陪伴需求，使主线部分偏离了维护尊严与怀念旧日归属之间的双向拉扯。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e2f9ee33-778f-47da-9519-fe37f896ca13", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T080349681606Z", "elapsed_seconds": 15.735, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T08:04:05.426506+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "dc658341a34739d11530c7190b8a7334e8ffc5e2d4b9e9f919860f22b39eddd6", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "